WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:07.370
. So we're going to separately discuss this
bizarre outburst that Donald Trump had on

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:09.019
Twitter over the weekend.

00:00:09.019 --> 00:00:15.329
But here, I want to focus in specifically
on the absolutely massive cyberattack believed

00:00:15.329 --> 00:00:18.650
to have been perpetrated by Russia on the
United States.

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:24.789
We've now learned of a massive and ongoing
long term cyber hack by Russia, with evidence

00:00:24.789 --> 00:00:27.240
mounting more and more that points to Russia.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:32.790
Now, of course, you can always say we can
never believe anything we're told about who

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:33.790
