00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:46.370
But the details as we know them right now
are that five major federal agencies were

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:50.080
breached according to multiple intelligence
agencies.

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:52.500
It's abundantly clear that it was Russia that
did it.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:57.450
Now, multiple intelligence agencies drafted
a statement saying Russia did this and the

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:00.780
White House blocked the release of that statement.

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:05.710
According to a senior administration official,
Donald Trump, Secretary of State Mike Pompeo

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:11.270
even appeared on right wing radio show on
the right wing radio show hosted by Mark Levin

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:16.140
and said, quote, We can say pretty clearly
that it was the Russians that engaged in this

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:17.140
activity.

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:21.680
Pompeo didn't get super specific, but U.S.
officials have said privately it was the Foreign

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:25.130
Intelligence Service, the SVR of Russia.

00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:28.450
That's what sort of replaced the KGB.

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:31.200
No one is suggesting China played a role.

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:34.320
They believe it was Russia, but not hugely
controversial.

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:39.800
But Donald Trump goes on Twitter and contradicts
