00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:55.550
Donald Trump tweeting, quote, This cyber hack
is far greater in the fake news media than

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:56.890
in actuality.

00:01:56.890 --> 00:02:00.750
I have been fully briefed and everything is
well under control.

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:06.940
Russia, Russia, Russia is the priority chant
when anything happens, because lame stream

00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:12.909
is, for mostly financial reasons, petrified
